                        </li>
                        <li class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                            <i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-success"></i>
                            <span>Sử dụng AVA AI thẩm định & gửi email nợ</span>
                        </li>
                    </ul>

                    <a href="/login" class="btn btn-primary rounded-pill w-100 fw-bold py-2 shadow-sm d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center gap-2">
